                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "content",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<h2>Enterprise Integration</h2><p>Many organizations are leveraging MCP to connect their AI systems with internal APIs, databases, and business processes. This enables automated workflows and intelligent decision-making at scale.</p><h3>Common Use Cases:</h3><ul><li>Customer service automation with access to CRM systems</li><li>Data analysis and reporting workflows</li><li>Content management and publishing pipelines</li><li>Financial data aggregation and analysis</li></ul>",
                      "blocks": {
                        "layout": {},
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": []
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "94546918-2c2b-4358-a800-c6c2399d0d08",
                "key": "57e1fa32-991a-4033-861f-9a444e685ae2",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "message",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<p>MCP is becoming the standard protocol for AI-to-system communication across industries, from healthcare to finance to manufacturing.</p>",
                      "blocks": {
